  "",
  "    // ---- the agent's mix pass ---------------------------------------------",
  "",
  "    /**",
  "     * Whether one history step is a mixer step: a mixer command whose writes are",
  "     * the mixer's own refs. insert.add names its owner's track as well (a lock",
  "     * and a focus are asked about a track), so a track ref is allowed here; any",
  "     * other ref means the step reached outside the mixer and ended the run.",
